6/Purple_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163140 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/06/Purple_Fireflies_Jar.png/revision/latest?cb=20240309163140 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Purple\" width=\"171\" height=\"271\" data-image-key=\"Purple Fireflies Jar.png\" data-image-name=\"Purple Fireflies Jar.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$2,000</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Catching Fireflies, Holding Jam or Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><big><i>\"Can be filled by clicking on fireflies around the map which can be found at night, if the jar is filled you can resell it to the Resource Hub for a profit! You can also use these for the Machine to create dyes and jams.\"</i></big>\n</p><p>The <b>Jar</b> is a tool that is used to catch <a href=\"/wiki/Fireflies\" title=\"Fireflies\">Fireflies</a>, storing <a href=\"/wiki/Fruits\" title=\"Fruits\">Jams</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">Dyes</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\">Details</span></h2>\n<p>By equipping the Jar, the player can interact with swarms of Fireflies that will eventually fill up the Jar. A Jar that is full of Fireflies can be taken back to the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a> and sold for a profit.\n</p><p>Using <a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a>, Jars can be filled with <a href=\"/wiki/Fruits\" title=\"Fruits\">Fruits</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Flowers\" title=\"Flowers\">Flowers</a> to corresponding Jams and Dyes. Both can be sold to gain profit, but Dyes are used as paint with <a href=\"/wiki/Dye_Machine\" title=\"Dye Machine\">Dye Machine</a>.\n</p><p>As of 1.54.3, Empty Jars cannot be sold. This is to avoid confusion.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Outdated_Tips\">Outdated Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Selling Jars is an easy way to earn cash early in the game. Even the cheapest Firefly variants will always turn a profit, so it is impossible to lose more than what is gained.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>There are two drawbacks to this method: Fireflies only spawn and persist at night, which means that they will disappear at sunrise, and this method also requires players to have enough money to purchase Jars.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Selling Jars is an easy way to earn cash early in the game. Jars now sell every firefly variant 2000$ cheaper than they were.  The fireflies empty out of the jar and the jar does not sell itself with fireflies anymore.</li></ul>\n<ul><li>There are two drawbacks to this method: Fireflies only spawn and persist at night, which means that they will disappear at sunrise, and this method also requires players to have enough money to purchase Jars.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903113920\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 41/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019389/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   39.611      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   39.611      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:1106-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop